1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Doctors put a TOOTH

2
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:02,830
inside this man’s EYE…

3
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:04,320
and he could SEE AGAIN.

4
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:06,130
His cornea was so damaged,

5
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:07,980
a normal transplant wouldn’t work.

6
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:08,940
So surgeons removed

7
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:09,660
one of his teeth

8
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,800
with a piece of bone,

9
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:11,920
drilled a hole through it,

10
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,815
and fitted a clear lens inside.

11
00:00:13,855 --> 00:00:14,925
They tucked it beneath the skin

12
00:00:14,965 --> 00:00:16,585
near his other eye for months,

13
00:00:16,625 --> 00:00:18,445
letting living tissue grow around it.

14
00:00:18,485 --> 00:00:19,765
Then they implanted it

15
00:00:19,805 --> 00:00:21,115
into his damaged eye,

16
00:00:21,155 --> 00:00:22,965
allowing light to reach his retina.

17
00:00:23,005 --> 00:00:25,055
After TEN YEARS blind…

18
00:00:25,095 --> 00:00:26,415
he could see again.

